WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.503
YONDU UDONTA
Why stop at one hero...

00:00:06.758 --> 00:00:09.224
...when we can
show you all of them.

00:00:09.275 --> 00:00:13.374
♪♪

00:00:13.425 --> 00:00:15.425
THE WATCHER
Heroes are forged in darkness,

00:00:15.816 --> 00:00:18.206
defined by sacrifice.

00:00:18.257 --> 00:00:21.628
There is still hope
for the Multiverse.

00:00:21.679 --> 00:00:23.647
♪♪

00:00:23.698 --> 00:00:24.675
STEPHEN STRANGE
Here we go.

00:00:25.089 --> 00:00:27.089
T'CHALLA
We do not back down from a fight.

00:00:27.555 --> 00:00:28.820
THANOS
Aye aye, commander.

00:00:30.047 --> 00:00:30.864
CLINT BARTON
Now or never.

00:00:33.985 --> 00:00:35.493
THOR
Zombies, great idea!

00:00:36.035 --> 00:00:37.618
NICK FURY
That doesn't sound ominous at all.

00:00:38.485 --> 00:00:39.443
SCOTT LANG
Hey!

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:41.458
PEGGY CARTER
Who needs a plan?

00:00:42.678 --> 00:00:43.744
I have a shield.

00:00:44.935 --> 00:00:48.131
♪♪

00:00:49.443 --> 00:00:50.240
HULK
[Growls]

00:01:01.863 --> 00:01:03.527
STEPHEN STRANGE
What happened to you?

00:01:03.578 --> 00:01:05.471
CORRUPTED STRANGE
You will see.

00:01:05.521 --> 00:01:07.569
♪♪

00:01:10.365 --> 00:01:12.362
THE WATCHER
Witness the biggest heroes

00:01:12.412 --> 00:01:14.018
of the Multiverse.

00:01:14.069 --> 00:01:16.243
HOWARD THE DUCK
Or small, if you catch my drift.

00:01:16.323 --> 00:01:18.878
♪♪

00:01:22.905 --> 00:01:23.968
HOWARD THE DUCK
You know what they say,

00:01:24.019 --> 00:01:26.003
when you're out of luck,
always go duck.

00:01:26.054 --> 00:01:28.405
T'CHALLA
I'm pretty sure no one says that.

